WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:31.041
Why isn't a wise person

2
00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:35.125
attracted to material sensory pleasures?

3
00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:36.416
Lord Krishna answers

4
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:39.000
this question in this verse....

5
00:00:43.666 --> 00:00:44.541
The senses

6
00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:47.208
and the pleasures they bring are 
not only momentary,

7
00:00:47.208 --> 00:00:48.666
but they're also

8
00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:53.458
the cause of human discontent and suffering.....

9
00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:54.416
Perhaps this might seem

10
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:57.375
contradictory to someone....

11
00:00:57.375 --> 00:00:59.083
and to eliminate their discontent

12
00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:01.083
and suffering,

13
00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:03.083
they seek supreme joy and peace

14
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:06.750
in material and sensory pleasures....

15
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.416
In this verse, Lord Krishna reveals the

16
00:01:08.416 --> 00:01:10.583
nature of these pleasures

17
00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:12.750
very simply....

18
00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:15.625
He says, the pleasures that arise from contact

19
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:19.541
between the senses and objects
 of sensory enjoyment....

20
00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:21.291
like delicious food,

21
00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:25.166
comfortable surroundings, or social praise

22
00:01:25.166 --> 00:01:27.791
– these provide only momentary happiness...

23
00:01:27.791 --> 00:01:29.625
And as soon as the experience

24
00:01:29.625 --> 00:01:30.916
of these pleasures ends.....

25
00:01:30.916 --> 00:01:32.916
one begins to feel emptiness

26
00:01:32.916 --> 00:01:35.458
and discontent in their mind.....

27
00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:36.583
This very emptiness

28
00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:37.583
and discontent

29
00:01:37.583 --> 00:01:45.416
regenerates the craving for material and
 sensory pleasures in one's mind.....

30
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:49.166
And this cycle of craving keeps one trapped 
in the web of these momentary pleasures....

31
00:01:49.166 --> 00:01:50.458
And this web

32
00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:52.041
becomes the cause of one's restlessness

33
00:01:52.041 --> 00:01:54.500
and discontent.....

34
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.791
Lord Krishna calls this "dukha-yonayah,"

35
00:01:57.791 --> 00:02:01.708
which means.... "the birthplace of suffering"!!!

36
00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:05.250
Just as pregnancy isn't immediately apparent

37
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.708
but becomes evident after a few months,

38
00:02:08.708 --> 00:02:09.833
similarly,

39
00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:12.791
though one might not immediately
 experience the suffering

40
00:02:12.791 --> 00:02:16.750
born from these material pleasures, but

41
00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:21.125
it inevitably manifests after some time.

42
00:02:21.125 --> 00:02:23.375
The very nature of material pleasures is....

43
00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:25.291
impermanence... meaning

44
00:02:25.291 --> 00:02:29.333
these pleasures are born and then end.....

45
00:02:29.333 --> 00:02:30.041
And as soon as

46
00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:32.458
the experience of material pleasure ends.....

47
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:33.500
one gets trapped again

48
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.541
in the cycle

49
00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:37.541
of attaining a new material pleasure...

50
00:02:37.541 --> 00:02:38.875
hoping that

51
00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:39.583
perhaps

52
00:02:39.583 --> 00:02:42.791
future pleasures will be permanent....

53
00:02:42.791 --> 00:02:43.541
And this cycle

54
00:02:43.541 --> 00:02:47.333
continues endlessly.....!!

55
00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:50.041
But when a person understands

56
00:02:50.041 --> 00:02:52.250
that the senses and the pleasures they bring

57
00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.041
are momentary....

58
00:02:54.041 --> 00:02:57.083
they abandon attachment to these pleasures..

59
00:02:57.083 --> 00:02:58.375
and by doing so,

60
00:02:58.375 --> 00:03:00.750
a person becomes wise.....

61
00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:03.291
The wise person, considering these
 pleasures as the cause

62
00:03:03.291 --> 00:03:05.375
of suffering and discontent,

63
00:03:05.375 --> 00:03:07.166
abandons attachment to them....

64
00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:10.333
and experiences supreme joy by connecting 
their inner self to the Supreme....

65
00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:14.791
and this inner joy doesn't depend
 on any material circumstance

66
00:03:14.791 --> 00:03:16.208
or sensory pleasure....

67
00:03:16.208 --> 00:03:19.041
By developing a spiritual connection

68
00:03:19.041 --> 00:03:23.041
with the Supreme,

69
00:03:23.041 --> 00:03:25.666
rising above the temporary
 attraction of sensory pleasures,

70
00:03:25.666 --> 00:03:26.791
one attains

71
00:03:26.791 --> 00:03:28.416
lasting happiness,

72
00:03:28.416 --> 00:03:31.458
peace, and supreme joy....!

73
00:03:36.375 --> 00:03:39.291
I know,

74
00:03:39.291 --> 00:03:44.041
all of you desire happiness.....

75
00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:48.333
But what is happiness?

76
00:03:48.333 --> 00:03:51.625
Is it obtained from delicious food,

77
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:55.541
entertainment, material objects, or praise

78
00:03:55.541 --> 00:03:59.833
from others....?

79
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:01.833
No!!

80
00:04:01.833 --> 00:04:04.500
These are merely momentary pleasures....

81
00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:08.541
that give you happiness for some time

82
00:04:08.541 --> 00:04:11.125
but ultimately

83
00:04:11.125 --> 00:04:16.500
provide only discontent and disappointment....!!!

84
00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:20.041
This is the nature of sensory pleasures....

85
00:04:20.041 --> 00:04:23.333
and when you get trapped
 in this maze of material

86
00:04:23.333 --> 00:04:28.041
and sensory pleasures..

87
00:04:28.041 --> 00:04:32.875
then you attain not lasting happiness and peace,

88
00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:35.083
but only discontent

89
00:04:35.083 --> 00:04:38.791
and suffering!

90
00:04:38.791 --> 00:04:40.500
Perhaps now

91
00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:44.458
you might wonder

92
00:04:44.458 --> 00:04:49.041
how to break free from this maze?

93
00:04:49.041 --> 00:04:51.125
The answer is...

94
00:04:51.125 --> 00:04:53.583
seek lasting happiness

95
00:04:53.583 --> 00:04:56.833
and peace within yourself!!

96
00:04:56.833 --> 00:05:01.875
It might take some time to achieve this state....

97
00:05:01.875 --> 00:05:03.083
but

98
00:05:03.083 --> 00:05:09.375
when you abandon material attachments and 
connect yourself with the Supreme,

99
00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:12.041
and begin to live your life 
according to higher values

100
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:15.916
and ideals....,

101
00:05:15.916 --> 00:05:20.583
then you attain true and lasting happiness...

102
00:05:20.583 --> 00:05:23.500
To achieve this inner happiness,

103
00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.875
embrace meditation, self-reflection,

104
00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:30.208
and spiritual study....

105
00:05:30.208 --> 00:05:34.166
and connect with individuals and actions

106
00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:37.250
that show you the right path....

107
00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:41.708
When you focus on this inner happiness,

108
00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:46.875
the craving for material 
pleasures will be destroyed....

109
00:05:46.875 --> 00:05:51.041
and this is the path that will lead you to lasting

110
00:05:51.041 --> 00:05:54.333
happiness and peace.....!!!

111
00:05:59.041 --> 00:06:01.666
Have you ever thought about

112
00:06:01.666 --> 00:06:08.916
why discontent and stress are
 increasing in society today?

113
00:06:08.916 --> 00:06:11.125
Think carefully....,

114
00:06:11.125 --> 00:06:12.916
in the current time,

115
00:06:12.916 --> 00:06:17.250
you've become so lost in material pleasures

116
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:21.375
that you've forgotten the path to 
lasting happiness and peace.....

117
00:06:21.375 --> 00:06:22.833
Material objects,

118
00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:26.208
physical pleasures, and the 
craving for momentary happiness...

119
00:06:26.208 --> 00:06:29.791
have become your priority.....

120
00:06:29.791 --> 00:06:31.291
But do they

121
00:06:31.291 --> 00:06:33.041
provide your mind with lasting

122
00:06:33.041 --> 00:06:35.750
happiness and peace?

123
00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.500
Let's understand the answer to this question

124
00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.500
with an example.....

125
00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.500
Imagine

126
00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:46.791
You are trying to fill a container with water

127
00:06:46.791 --> 00:06:50.500
that has a hole.

128
00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:54.708
Will that container ever fill up?

129
00:06:54.708 --> 00:06:56.625
No....!!!!

130
00:06:56.625 --> 00:06:59.791
No matter how much water you pour,

131
00:06:59.791 --> 00:07:02.708
it will never fill....

132
00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:07.041
This is the situation with material pleasure....

133
00:07:07.041 --> 00:07:09.541
The more you acquire.....

134
00:07:09.541 --> 00:07:12.541
the more the craving grows....

135
00:07:12.541 --> 00:07:17.208
and this very craving grips your mind.....

136
00:07:17.208 --> 00:07:19.916
and this cycle creates

137
00:07:19.916 --> 00:07:24.291
discontent and restlessness in your mind....

138
00:07:24.291 --> 00:07:27.041
In current times,

139
00:07:27.041 --> 00:07:30.250
society has formed the belief

140
00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:32.291
that happiness and peace

141
00:07:32.291 --> 00:07:34.916
are attained only through

142
00:07:34.916 --> 00:07:38.083
material success, expensive clothes

143
00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:42.958
and cars, and physical indulgence....

144
00:07:42.958 --> 00:07:45.041
but

145
00:07:45.041 --> 00:07:51.291
this cycle of craving for entertainment
 and social prestige

146
00:07:51.291 --> 00:07:56.666
traps you in an endless race....

147
00:07:56.666 --> 00:08:01.208
where you attain only suffering,

148
00:08:01.208 --> 00:08:04.791
and in your mind

149
00:08:04.791 --> 00:08:07.666
all you experience is a void

150
00:08:07.666 --> 00:08:10.166
and this void

151
00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:13.500
fills you with stress, restlessness,

152
00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:17.125
and discontent....

153
00:08:17.125 --> 00:08:19.500
In this modern age,

154
00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.208
the happiness and peace

155
00:08:21.208 --> 00:08:24.666
you're seeking in material objects....

156
00:08:24.666 --> 00:08:27.208
are actually

157
00:08:27.208 --> 00:08:29.958
the cause of your mental anguish

158
00:08:29.958 --> 00:08:32.875
and suffering.

159
00:08:32.875 --> 00:08:36.416
When you chase after material pleasures

160
00:08:36.416 --> 00:08:39.041
and ignore the values

161
00:08:39.041 --> 00:08:42.583
and peace within yourself,

162
00:08:42.583 --> 00:08:46.083
your life becomes imbalanced

163
00:08:46.083 --> 00:08:48.916
and restless.....

164
00:08:48.916 --> 00:08:55.375
When you begin to live your 
life with higher values and ideals...

165
00:08:55.375 --> 00:08:57.125
then you experience lasting happiness

166
00:08:57.125 --> 00:08:59.791
and peace.

167
00:08:59.791 --> 00:09:02.125
And this is the path

168
00:09:02.125 --> 00:09:06.916
that leads not only you, but your
 family and the entire society

169
00:09:06.916 --> 00:09:11.833
towards lasting happiness, 
peace, and contentment....

170
00:09:11.833 --> 00:09:13.375
Now,

171
00:09:13.375 --> 00:09:16.791
ask yourself a question.

172
00:09:16.791 --> 00:09:21.458
Do sensory pleasures provide 
you with lasting happiness and peace?

173
00:09:21.458 --> 00:09:24.666
Or do they trap you in a maze....

174
00:09:24.666 --> 00:09:28.875
where there's only discontent and suffering???

175
00:09:28.875 --> 00:09:33.166
When you find the answer to 
this question yourself.... 

176
00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:34.125
then

177
00:09:34.125 --> 00:09:37.541
you'll be free from this cycle of suffering

178
00:09:37.541 --> 00:09:43.541
and will be able to create a 
happy and prosperous society.....!!!

179
00:09:48.083 --> 00:09:50.041
In current times,

180
00:09:50.041 --> 00:09:52.875
the measure of professional success

181
00:09:52.875 --> 00:09:55.583
is seen in the form of material
 rewards, promotions,

182
00:09:55.583 --> 00:09:59.375
and social praise....

183
00:09:59.375 --> 00:10:01.791
Perhaps these achievements

184
00:10:01.791 --> 00:10:05.750
can be a cause of joy,

185
00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:10.875
but do they provide true satisfaction....?

186
00:10:10.875 --> 00:10:13.500
No....!!

187
00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.583
When you receive a

188
00:10:15.583 --> 00:10:19.750
promotion, praise, or salary 
increase in an organization....

189
00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:21.291
initially,

190
00:10:21.291 --> 00:10:24.291
it feels extremely pleasant....

191
00:10:24.291 --> 00:10:30.250
but this happiness doesn't last long.....

192
00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.958
and soon, the desire to acquire more

193
00:10:32.958 --> 00:10:36.708
is born in your mind.

194
00:10:36.708 --> 00:10:40.333
This endless desire becomes 
the cause of competition,

195
00:10:40.333 --> 00:10:41.583
stress,

196
00:10:41.583 --> 00:10:45.291
and discord in the workplace,

197
00:10:45.291 --> 00:10:49.166
and can lead you to unethical behaviour...

198
00:10:49.166 --> 00:10:51.916
This very desire makes your mind restless

199
00:10:51.916 --> 00:10:53.833
and dissatisfied.

200
00:10:53.833 --> 00:10:56.541
Remember,

201
00:10:56.541 --> 00:11:00.541
you attain inner satisfaction,

202
00:11:00.541 --> 00:11:03.041
when you connect your work to a

203
00:11:03.041 --> 00:11:06.291
higher purpose....

204
00:11:06.291 --> 00:11:08.125
and abandon the attachment to material praise

205
00:11:08.125 --> 00:11:12.166
and rewards..

206
00:11:12.166 --> 00:11:15.791
When you focus on the quality of your work,

207
00:11:15.791 --> 00:11:17.708
its impact, and personal growth
 through your efforts....

208
00:11:17.708 --> 00:11:23.666
and personal growth through your efforts....

209
00:11:23.666 --> 00:11:26.375
then you attain inner satisfaction

210
00:11:26.375 --> 00:11:30.125
and supreme joy....

211
00:11:30.125 --> 00:11:32.416
This inner satisfaction

212
00:11:32.416 --> 00:11:36.375
provides you with complete concentration

213
00:11:36.375 --> 00:11:39.458
and self-confidence in your work.....

214
00:11:39.458 --> 00:11:43.666
and makes you successful in
 professional life....!!!
